<title>USA: New Image Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>New Image Q1 loss.</headline>
<text>
<p>CARLSBAD, Calif., Nov. 15 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				  New Image Industries, Inc.</p>
<p>			  Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>			 For each of the three month period ended</p>
<p>				 September 30, 1996 and 1995</p>
<p>				   Three months ended</p>
<p>				    September 30,</p>
<p>					     1996	     1995</p>
<p>Net Revenues			 $6,193,000     $7,313,000</p>
<p>     Cost of Revenues	     3,926,000	4,896,000</p>
<p>	    Gross profit	    2,267,000	2,417,000</p>
<p>Selling, general and administrative</p>
<p>	 expenses		     3,179,000	4,107,000</p>
<p>Research and development expenses</p>
<p>					    283,000	  408,000</p>
<p>     Loss from Operations     (1,195,000)    (2,098,000)</p>
<p>Interest (income) expense, net</p>
<p>					    117,000	   58,000</p>
<p>     Other (income) expense, net   15,000	   73,000</p>
<p>     Net Loss		     (1,327,000)    (2,229,000)</p>
<p>     Net Loss Per Share	     $(0.24)	  $(0.41)</p>
<p>	    Weighted average shares of common</p>
<p>		stock outstanding    5,449,000	5,441,000</p>
